      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_eff9a5900e7e38f9c03dd72a5ab01f3e504841abcf7587082c0a83b086b3cc38"
      ],
      "text": "The stack comprises a React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 6 frontend, a Rust backend using Tauri 2, Tailwind CSS v4 with shadcn/ui, and SQLite via rusqlite, with Bun as package manager."
    },
