  "summary": "Selected evidence records: opcode is a desktop GUI application and toolkit for Claude Code, supporting custom agent creation, interactive session management, and background agent execution. The stack comprises a React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 6 frontend, a Rust backend using Tauri 2, Tailwind CSS v4 with shadcn/ui, and SQLite via rusqlite, with Bun as package manager.",
